B = {}
B['blog/meta-ads-vs-google-ads-dubai.html'] = dict(
 title='Meta Ads vs Google Ads for Dubai Businesses',
 desc='Meta ads or Google ads for your Dubai business? How each works, which suits your category, and how to split testing between them. A practical guide.',
 h1='Meta Ads vs Google Ads', h1em='for Dubai Businesses', eyebrow='Guide · Performance marketing', imgs='ads',
 links=['performance-marketing.html','marketing-agency-dubai.html','social-media-marketing-dubai.html'],
 sections=[
  ('The short answer', ['Google Ads captures demand that already exists; Meta Ads (Facebook and Instagram) creates demand that doesn&rsquo;t exist yet. If people in Dubai already search for what you sell, such as &ldquo;AC repair Al Barsha&rdquo; or &ldquo;corporate video production Dubai&rdquo;, Google Search should usually come first. If your product sells on looks, lifestyle or emotion, like a new restaurant, a fashion label or an off-plan launch, Meta usually comes first. Most growing businesses end up using both.']),
  ('How Google Ads works for Dubai businesses', ['On Google Search you bid on keywords and your ad appears when someone searches. The intent is high, which is why it suits services and urgent needs. Success depends on tight keyword selection, negative keywords to filter out irrelevant searches (job seekers, DIY, other emirates if you don&rsquo;t serve them), ads that match the search closely, and a landing page that answers the question immediately. Location targeting matters in the UAE: decide whether you serve all of Dubai, specific areas or the wider UAE, and whether to include people merely interested in Dubai.']),
  ('How Meta Ads works for Dubai businesses', ['On Instagram and Facebook your ad interrupts someone&rsquo;s feed, so the creative does most of the work. Targeting is increasingly automated, meaning the platform finds buyers based on who responds to your ad. That makes creative variety the main lever: different hooks, formats (reels, stories, carousels, statics) and angles. Dubai&rsquo;s audience is highly visual and international, so creative that tells the story with images and short on-screen text tends to travel across languages better than heavy copy.']),
  ('Which categories lean which way', ['<strong>Lean Google</strong>: home services, clinics and treatments, legal and business setup, B2B services, car rental, urgent needs. <strong>Lean Meta</strong>: restaurants and cafes, fashion and beauty, events, real estate launches, D2C products, fitness. <strong>Both</strong>: real estate brokers, hotels, education, premium services where buyers both search and browse.']),
  ('Tracking first, either way', ['Neither platform can optimise without good data. Before spending, set up conversion tracking: the Meta pixel and Conversions API, Google Ads conversions or GA4 imports via Tag Manager, and a clear definition of a real lead such as a WhatsApp click, a form submission or a call. Without this you are paying for clicks, not customers.']),
  ('A sensible way to start', ['Start with the platform that matches your demand type, run it properly with tracking and enough creative or keyword coverage to learn, and add the second platform once the first is stable. Review on cost per real enquiry, not clicks or likes. If you want help choosing, see <a href="/performance-marketing.html">performance marketing</a> or get in touch for a quote.'])],
 faqs=[('Is Google Ads or Meta Ads cheaper in Dubai?','Costs vary by category, season and competition, and change constantly, so the honest answer is: compare on cost per real enquiry in your own account, not on headline click prices.'),
  ('Can I run both from the start?','Yes, if you have enough budget and creative to give each a fair test. Otherwise start with one.'),
  ('Do I need Arabic ads?','It depends on your audience. Many Dubai campaigns run in English; Arabic versions help when your buyers prefer it.')])

B['blog/brand-video-cost-bangalore.html'] = dict(
 title='Cost of a Brand Video in Bangalore: What Drives It',
 desc='What affects the cost of a brand video in Bangalore: shoot days, crew, locations, talent, versions and usage. How to brief so you get an accurate quote.',
 h1='What Affects the Cost', h1em='of a Brand Video in Bangalore', eyebrow='Guide · Video production', imgs='video',
 links=['video-production.html','videographer-bangalore.html','corporate-video-bangalore.html','marketing-agency-bangalore.html'],
 sections=[
  ('Why there&rsquo;s no single price', ['Two brand videos of the same length can differ enormously in effort. A founder talking to camera in one office is a very different job from a multi-location product film with actors. Rather than quote a range that would mislead you, here are the factors that actually move the number, so you can brief well and compare quotes fairly.']),
  ('1. Shoot days', ['The biggest driver. Bangalore traffic matters here: two locations in Whitefield and Koramangala can eat half a day in transit. Grouping locations by area and planning an efficient shot list often saves an entire shoot day.']),
  ('2. Crew size', ['A compact crew (a videographer with a gimbal and wireless audio, like my Sony A7 IV and DJI RS3 setup) is right for most startup and corporate videos. Bigger productions add a director, gaffer, sound recordist, makeup and assistants, each adding cost and coordination.']),
  ('3. Pre-production', ['Scripting, storyboards, location scouting, casting and permissions. More planning usually means less shoot time and fewer surprises, so it&rsquo;s rarely wasted.']),
  ('4. Talent and locations', ['Using your own team is cheapest. Professional actors, models or voice-over artists add fees, and sometimes usage fees. Studios, cafes and premium venues may charge for location time.']),
  ('5. Versions and post-production', ['One horizontal master is different from a master plus vertical cut-downs, subtitled versions and stills. Decide where the video will live (website, YouTube, LinkedIn, Instagram ads) before the shoot so the right formats are captured on the day.']),
  ('6. Usage', ['Organic use on your own channels is standard. Paid ad usage, broadcast or long-term usage of talent can change the cost.']),
  ('How to get an accurate quote', ['Share the goal, audience, where it will be published, rough length, number of locations, whether you have people to appear on camera, any reference videos you like, and your deadline. With that I can give one fixed project price. See <a href="/video-production.html">video production</a> or <a href="/videographer-bangalore.html">videographer in Bangalore</a>.'])],
 faqs=[('Can I reduce the cost without hurting quality?','Yes: fewer locations, your own team on camera, a tight script and batching several videos into one shoot day.'),
  ('Do you publish rates?','No. Every brief is different, so I give a fixed written quote after understanding it.'),
  ('Is a drone included?','I don&rsquo;t fly drones; if you need aerials a licensed operator is quoted separately.')])

B['blog/linkedin-personal-branding-founders-mumbai.html'] = dict(
 title='LinkedIn Personal Branding for Founders in Mumbai',
 desc='A practical LinkedIn personal branding playbook for Mumbai founders: positioning, content pillars, photos and video, cadence and when to add ads.',
 h1='LinkedIn Personal Branding', h1em='for Founders in Mumbai', eyebrow='Guide · Personal branding', imgs='linkedin',
 links=['linkedin-marketing.html','marketing-agency-mumbai.html','brand-strategy.html'],
 sections=[
  ('Why founders, and why LinkedIn', ['In Mumbai&rsquo;s finance, media, fashion and D2C circles, investors, partners and senior hires check the founder before they check the company. A founder with a clear, consistent LinkedIn presence makes every other conversation easier: sales calls start warmer, recruiting gets easier and press finds you.']),
  ('Step 1: decide what you want to be known for', ['Pick one or two themes you can talk about with real authority, such as building a D2C brand from Mumbai, lessons from fintech compliance, or what fashion retail is getting wrong. Narrow beats broad. Write a one-line positioning statement and rewrite your headline around it.']),
  ('Step 2: fix the profile', ['A professional, natural portrait (not a cropped wedding photo), a banner that says what the company does, an About section written for your buyer, and a Featured section with your best work. These are what people see when they click your name after a meeting.']),
  ('Step 3: three content pillars', ['For example: lessons from building the company, opinions on your industry, and behind-the-scenes of the team. Rotate between them. Mix formats: text posts, carousels, short talking-head videos and photos from real moments.']),
  ('Step 4: make video easy', ['Short videos perform well on LinkedIn but founders rarely have time. Batch them: one well-lit session with a proper mic can produce a month of clips. I shoot these with a Sony A7 IV and DJI wireless mic, so the founder only has to talk.']),
  ('Step 5: cadence and engagement', ['Two to three posts a week is sustainable for most founders. Spend time commenting thoughtfully on others&rsquo; posts in your space; it builds visibility faster than posting alone.']),
  ('Step 6: when to add LinkedIn ads', ['Once you have posts that resonate organically, thought-leadership ads can put them in front of a targeted audience by title and company. It&rsquo;s a strong fit for B2B founders with a meaningful deal size. More on <a href="/linkedin-marketing.html">LinkedIn marketing &amp; personal branding</a>.'])],
 faqs=[('Should I write my own posts?','The ideas and opinions must be yours. Help with structure, editing and planning is fine and common.'),
  ('How long does it take to see results?','Expect months of consistent posting. It compounds.'),
  ('Do I need professional photos?','A natural, professional portrait and a few real working shots make a visible difference to credibility.')])

B['blog/marketing-agency-vs-consultant-india.html'] = dict(
 title='Marketing Agency vs Consultant: Which Do You Need?',
 desc='Should you hire a marketing agency, a consultant or a freelancer in Bangalore, Mumbai or Delhi? Differences in scope, speed, cost drivers and control.',
 h1='Marketing Agency vs Consultant', h1em='Which Do You Need?', eyebrow='Guide · Marketing', imgs='mkt',
 links=['marketing.html','marketing-agency-bangalore.html','marketing-agency-mumbai.html','marketing-agency-delhi.html'],
 sections=[
  ('Three models', ['<strong>Agency</strong>: a team covering strategy, creative, media and account management. <strong>Consultant</strong>: an experienced individual who sets direction and often guides your in-house team. <strong>Freelancer</strong>: a specialist executing one thing, such as ads, design or video. Each fits a different stage.']),
  ('When an agency makes sense', ['You need many channels running at once, large volumes of creative, and you have the budget for a team. The trade-off is layers: your brief passes through account managers, and the senior people who pitched may not do the work.']),
  ('When a consultant makes sense', ['You need clear strategy and someone senior hands-on, but not a large team. Consultants suit startups and SMEs in Bangalore, Mumbai and Delhi who want direct access to the person making decisions.']),
  ('When a freelancer makes sense', ['You already know what you need and just need execution capacity in one skill.']),
  ('The hybrid model', ['YKS Productions sits between consultant and agency: I set the strategy and also produce the content myself (photo, video and reels), and run campaigns on Meta, Google and LinkedIn. Specialists are added only when a project needs them. It suits brands that want senior attention without agency overhead.']),
  ('What affects cost', ['Scope (number of channels), content volume, whether strategy only or full execution, contract length and ad management complexity. Compare proposals on what is actually delivered each month, not just the fee.']),
  ('Questions to ask before hiring', ['Who will actually do the work? Do I own the ad accounts and content? How will results be reported? What happens if something isn&rsquo;t working? Can I see real past work? (Mine includes Vaseline (Unilever), Marriott, KL Rahul and Cindrebay School of Design.)'])],
 faqs=[('Is a consultant cheaper than an agency?','Often, but compare on scope. The right question is which model delivers what you need.'),
  ('Can a consultant work with my in-house team?','Yes, that&rsquo;s one of the most common setups.'),
  ('Do you work across India?','Yes: Bangalore, Mumbai and Delhi NCR, plus Dubai and Abu Dhabi.')])

B['blog/plan-a-content-shoot-day.html'] = dict(
 title='How to Plan a Content Shoot Day: Reels, UGC & Photos',
 desc='How brands can plan one content shoot day that produces a month of reels, UGC and photos. Shot lists, hooks, locations, kit and delivery.',
 h1='How to Plan a Content Shoot Day', h1em='for a Month of Posts', eyebrow='Guide · Content creation', imgs='content',
 links=['content-creation.html','social-media-marketing.html','content-creator-dubai.html','content-creator-bangalore.html'],
 sections=[
  ('Why batch your content', ['Shooting one post at a time is slow and inconsistent. A planned shoot day captures a month&rsquo;s worth of reels, UGC and photos in one look, with one setup. It&rsquo;s how I run content for brands.']),
  ('1. Start with the calendar, not the camera', ['List the posts you need for the month: how many reels, carousels, stories and ad variations. Group them by pillar such as product, people, behind-the-scenes and education.']),
  ('2. Write hooks before shot lists', ['For each reel, write the first line or first visual. The hook decides whether anyone watches. Then list the shots needed to pay it off.']),
  ('3. Group shots by location and light', ['Move through the day by location, and shoot exteriors when the light is soft. In Dubai that means early morning or golden hour; in Bangalore overcast days are a gift.']),
  ('4. Plan UGC separately', ['UGC-style clips need a different setup: phone-style framing, natural light, a person talking to camera. Schedule them as a block, with a wireless mic for clean audio.']),
  ('5. Capture stills alongside video', ['Photos for the feed, website and ads can come from the same scenes. With a camera like the Sony A7 IV switching between stills and video is quick.']),
  ('6. Shoot vertical and horizontal deliberately', ['Decide per shot. Vertical for reels and stories, horizontal for YouTube and web. Cropping later loses quality and framing.']),
  ('7. Deliver organised files', ['Name and sort files by post, so publishing is easy. See <a href="/content-creation.html">content creation</a> for how I run this for brands.'])],
 faqs=[('How much content comes from one day?','It depends on locations, number of setups and formats. A clear shot list maximises it.'),
  ('Do I need professional talent?','Not always. Your team and real customers often work better for UGC.'),
  ('Can the same shoot feed ads?','Yes. Plan ad variations into the shot list.')])
